        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-a-forex-currency-pair"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">点差可能比交易活跃的主要货币对变化更大</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8516492b547a84b7",
