    },
    {
      "key": "tf74a0e0274fa2b70",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Which Currency Pairs Are Most Traded?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs//what-is-a-forex-currency-pair#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-a-forex-currency-pair"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">哪些货币对交易量最大？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf841255f000a8c13",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The most actively traded forex pairs are heavily concentrated around the U.S. dollar, with major pairs accounting for much of global FX activity.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs//what-is-a-forex-currency-pair#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-a-forex-currency-pair"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">交易最活跃的外汇货币对主要集中在美元，主要货币对占据了全球外汇活动的大部分。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4cd360af5b774539",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The latest BIS survey recorded an average OTC foreign-exchange turnover of approximately </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">$9.6 trillion per day in April 2025</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">, highlighting the scale of the global currency market. The dollar remained the dominant currency, appearing on one side of </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">89% of all FX trades</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs//what-is-a-forex-currency-pair#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-a-forex-currency-pair"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">BIS最新调查记录，场外外汇交易日均交易额约为</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">2025年四月每天9.6万亿美元</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">，凸显全球货币市场的规模。美元仍占主导地位，是</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">全部外汇交易中89%的交易的一方</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t52f5343c9d54563a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For beginners, pairs such as EUR/USD, USD/JPY and GBP/USD are among the most recognisable examples to study when learning how forex quotations work.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs//what-is-a-forex-currency-pair#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-a-forex-currency-pair"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">对于初学者来说，欧元/美元、美元/日元和英镑/美元等货币对是学习外汇报价如何运作时最知名的研究示例。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te282c70b6b4a2e6d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Trading hours</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs//what-is-a-forex-currency-pair#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-a-forex-currency-pair"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">交易时间</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t542f5c33c4c87efb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Spread and other costs</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
