    },
    {
      "key": "tc80b9ae2a9884a5a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">May weaken as the USD and yields rise</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">随着美元和收益率上升，可能会走软</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf16d18b8e6b8a69e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Near forecast</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">接近预期</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t70a3017340734479",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Often range-bound unless another detail surprises</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">通常会受到范围限制，除非另一个细节令人惊讶</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9bbbb073e50319cd",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">May strengthen as the USD and yields fall</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">随着美元和收益率下跌，可能会走强</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1dfeed7edc526322",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Often strengthens if traders price tighter policy</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">如果交易者定价收紧政策，通常会走强</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t63813ca6869868aa",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">May fall as expected borrowing costs increase</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">由于预期借贷成本增加，可能会下降</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb5324190f4816454",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">May remain range-bound</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">可能保持区间波动</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1f8f9942a3486f96",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">May strengthen as yields decline</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">随着收益率下降，可能会走强</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8a318648f1e7c572",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">1. Compare Actual With Forecast</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">1。比较实际与预测</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tacaa876ab1c00462",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">2. Identify What Was Already Priced In</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">2。确定已经定价的内容</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf5aa59f8bf0c2f6c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Markets trade expectations. A rate hike may not strengthen the dollar if it was fully expected and the Fed signals that no more hikes are likely.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">市场交易预期。如果加息完全在预期之中并且美联储暗示不太可能再次加息，那么加息可能不会让美元走强。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t368582c9a1745c93",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">3. Watch the First and Second Moves</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">3. 观察最初和随后的价格变动</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t061a56ad7f3c8fdd",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">4. Check Spreads and Slippage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">4。检查点差和滑点</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9e73bf33f1e37efb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">During high-impact releases, the bid-ask spread can widen and available liquidity can change. A stop-loss limits risk intent but does not guarantee execution at the requested price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在高影响力的发布期间，买卖价差可能会扩大，可用流动性可能会发生变化。止损限制风险意图，但不保证按要求的价格执行。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t3089b0394d3f1407",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Holding correlated exposure:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> Long USD, short gold, and short EUR/USD positions may express the same underlying view.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">持有相关风险敞口：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">多头美元、空头黄金和空头欧元/美元头寸可能表达相同的基本观点。</span>"
    }
  ]
}
